8;\n    w >>= 8;\n    *dst.add(7) = w as u8;\n}\n\n#[inline(always)]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01VfYL3GAAL2gPR2hkUto7KH","session_id":"dbed778e-b40b-44c3-aae8-c706753ef0ef","uuid":"69a0b5a4-0d5a-43d2-9d80-fe458dc22988","timestamp":"2026-08-22T13:49:06.253Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Translate secretbox and box"}
