age single-pass `chunk` selection (`mlen <= 64ULL * (0xffffffffULL - 1ULL) ? 131072 : mlen`), reproduced verbatim.\n- **No `memmove` in `crypto_aead_chacha20poly1305_decrypt`** in this version — decryption is a direct `crypto_stream_chacha20_xor_ic(m, c, mlen, npub, 1U, k)`, which is memmove-safe for `m == c`. Verified with an explicit in-place decrypt test.\n- **`ACQUIRE_FENCE` expands to `(void) 0`** — neither `HAVE_GCC_MEMORY_FENCES` nor `HAVE_C11_MEMORY_FENCES` is defined in the reference build, so no fence is emitted (noted in a comment).\n- **`quirks.h` renames nothing here** — all names are used verbatim.\n- Both encrypt paths use `STREAM_POLY1305_CHUNK = 131072` chunked Poly1305 with `ic` advanced by `cl / 64`; the non-IETF `ic` is `u64`, the IETF/ext ones are `u32` with wrapping add.\n- `crypto_onetimeauth_poly1305_state` is declared locally as `#[repr(C, align(16))] { opaque: [u8; 256] }`.\n\n## Functional verification (linked against the built `.so`, stubbing other agents' unfinished symbols)\n\n- RFC 8439 §2.8.2 IETF ChaCha20-Poly1305 test vector: **exact ciphertext + tag match**.\n- IETF decrypt, in-place decrypt (`m == c`), tamper rejection (returns `-1` and writes `*mlen_p = 0`), `clen < ABYTES` rejection: all correct.\n- Original 8-byte-nonce construction cross-checked byte-for-byte against an independently assembled Poly1305 input (`ad || LE64(adlen) || c || LE64(mlen)`, no padding): match.\n- IETF padding sweep over all 1681 combinations of `adlen`/`mlen` in 0..40, each compared against an independently built padded Poly1305 input: all match.\n- `xchacha20poly1305_ietf_encrypt` output identical to `chacha20poly1305_ietf_encrypt` with the hchacha20-derived subkey and `0000 || npub[16..24]` nonce.\n- Multi-chunk messages (300007 bytes, spanning 3 chunks, not a multiple of 64) produce ciphertext identical to a single-shot `*_xor_ic` call for all three constructions, confirming the `ic` bookkeeping.\n- Constant accessors: `ietf_messagebytes_max() == 274877906880`, non-IETF and xchacha `== 2^64 - 17`, `npubbytes` 12 / 24."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":505,"cache_read_input_tokens":85574,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":505,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01J4Gi6KjdvHgGAt21QCTvFC","session_id":"dbed778e-b40b-44c3-aae8-c706753ef0ef","uuid":"9e4823c1-21ff-425e-b9ad-a5dc7158402b","timestamp":"2026-08-22T13:53:55.336Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Translate chacha20poly1305 AEADs"}
